WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.430
Welcome to Lumen.

2
00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.510
This is your projects dashboard,

3
00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.050
where everything your team is working on lives.

4
00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:08.690
Let's set up a brand new project together,

5
00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:10.570
and it will only take a few clicks.

6
00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:14.230
To begin, find the button for creating a new

7
00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:15.390
project and click it.

8
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.550
A small window opens, ready for the details.

9
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:21.633
Now give the project a name.

10
00:00:21.853 --> 00:00:23.973
Something short and clear works best.

11
00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:26.073
We'll call this one Spring campaign.

12
00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:28.193
You can always rename it later,

13
00:00:28.353 --> 00:00:30.253
so there is no pressure to get it perfect.

14
00:00:31.683 --> 00:00:33.103
When you are happy with the name,

15
00:00:33.443 --> 00:00:34.823
confirm to create the project.

16
00:00:35.223 --> 00:00:37.323
It appears at the top of your list straight

17
00:00:37.323 --> 00:00:40.383
away, marked as new, so nobody has to wonder

18
00:00:40.383 --> 00:00:41.343
whether it saved.

19
00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:45.413
Click the project to open it.

20
00:00:45.593 --> 00:00:47.873
You land in a clean workspace with your first

21
00:00:47.873 --> 00:00:49.073
tasks already waiting.

22
00:00:49.753 --> 00:00:52.233
Tasks, files and teammates all live here.

23
00:00:52.453 --> 00:00:53.453
That's all it takes.
